# Runtime needs the package and data/*.json (the literature parameters engine.py
# loads). Everything else is bulk: stl/ is 6.9 MB of regenerable meshes, docs/ 3.4 MB
# of figures, and biocast/.venv is a stray 13 MB virtualenv that must never ship.
.git
.github
.claude
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
stl/
docs/
examples/
deploy/
out/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
